p47wn7gqh4oe5eij/bafkreictz5mfmy5mz6s6orrdgsmx3nr4vgog4kie4gezhdx2nhn2irhski","cat":"문화","text":"I agree. Best show of its kind since THE SHIELD. Will it be back?","t":"2026-11-26T15:13:49.824Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/stephenking.bsky.social/post/3n37xm2ip2s2n","img":"","likes":270,"reposts":9,"replies":11,"text_ko":"동의합니다. SHIELD 이후 최고의 쇼입니다. 돌아올까요?"},{"id":"b3n37xjhyzdk2n","net":"bluesky","name":"Stephen King","handle":"@stephenking.bsky.social","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:h7obn4tkp47wn7gqh4oe5eij/bafkreictz5mfmy5mz6s6orrdgsmx3nr4vgog4kie4gezhdx2nhn2irhski","cat":"문화","text":"Joe is a hard character to like.","t":"2026-11-26T15:12:23.327Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/stephenking.bsky.social/post/3n37xjhyzdk2n","img":"","likes":163,"reposts":4,"replies":6,"text_ko":"조는 좋아하기 힘든 캐릭터다."},{"id":"b3n37n45xpx226","net":"bluesky","name":"Stephen King","handle":"@stephenking.bsky.social","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:h7obn4tkp47wn7gqh4oe5eij/bafkreictz5mfmy5mz6s6orrdgsmx3nr4vgog4kie4gezhdx2nhn2irhski","cat":"문화","text":"LIONESS: Joe explains \"freedom\" to her girls, while they are living on an Army post due to threats on Joe's life, and the girls are being home schooled. In other words, their current situation turns her monologue about freedom into a bitter joke. I like the show but could do with less preaching.","t":"2026-11-26T12:05:59.173Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/stephenking.bsky.social/post/3n37n45xpx226","img":"","likes":517,"reposts":26,"replies":40,"text_ko":"LIONESS: 조는 딸들에게 \"자유\"를 설명합니다. 딸들은 조의 생명에 대한 위협으로 인해 군부대에서 생활하고 있으며, 딸들은 홈스쿨링을 받고 있습니다. 즉, 그들의 현재 상황은 그녀의 자유에 대한 독백을 신랄한 농담으로 변화시킨다. 나는 쇼를 좋아하지만 설교를 덜해도 괜찮습니다."},{"id":"b3n36dpgdokk22","net":"bluesky","name":"Barack Obama","handle":"@barackobama.bsky.social","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:5c6cw3veuqruljoy5ahzerfx/bafkreigzylod45x3ioqaiwc5fyqogk7yfivssea3qkgorsz3ed6wko46xq","cat":"정치","text":"Ahead of the holiday, Michelle and I got a chance to pack some boxes of food for families in need with the team at Dion’s Chicago Dream. \n\nWishing everyone celebrating tomorrow a wonderful Thanksgiving!","t":"2026-11-25T23:45:08.330Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/barackobama.bsky.social/post/3n36dpgdokk22","img":"","likes":11631,"reposts":1773,"replies":315,"text_ko":"휴가를 앞두고 Michelle과 저는 Dion's Chicago Dream 팀과 함께 도움이 필요한 가족들을 위해 음식 몇 상자를 포장할 기회를 얻었습니다. \n\n내일을 축하하는 모든 사람들이 멋진 추수감사절을 보내길 바랍니다!"},{"id":"b3n2tynzp4gs2t","net":"bluesky","name":"Jay 🦋","handle":"@jay.bsky.team","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:oky5czdrnfjpqslsw2a5iclo/bafkreihxtnc37g7jqdcgidtkknwuswtjiijcdnc6cx4imc4oq33cnsc5da","cat":"IT","text":"🥹","t":"2026-11-21T21:00:52.976Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/jay.bsky.team/post/3n2tynzp4gs2t","img":"","likes":124,"reposts":11,"replies":3,"text_ko":"🥹"},{"id":"b3n3eby7gd2z2d","net":"bluesky","name":"The Associated Press","handle":"@apnews.com","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:a67zdrt4nl2tv2qojpngogbq/bafkreicqe453w2txy6eyooe4a6dbtvmflmfp7ydzunwjxuulvmgvntp42a","cat":"언론","text":"The UrbanBEE project in South Africa is exploring how cities affect bee diversity by recruiting volunteers as citizen scientists.","t":"2026-11-28T08:30:13Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/apnews.com/post/3n3eby7gd2z2d","img":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:a67zdrt4nl2tv2qojpngogbq/bafkreidksqwb6y7bvew2gvdvgnhmvb7qdpgomrxlobolf4mxxdrbb3qvzi","likes":6,"reposts":2,"replies":1,"text_ko":""},{"id":"b3n3ebp4vao72g","net":"bluesky","name":"Reuters","handle":"@reuters.com","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jbvnehrrdqoulco4rf5gxg5r/bafkreibl5cibo6e7epl3pomyqeu7pkvb6yo7zg6q3wf2o4syej5yycrepy","cat":"언론","text":"Armed group boards cargo ship off Yemen and takes control, UKMTO says reut.rs/49rlbE9","t":"2026-11-28T08:25:09Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/reuters.com/post/3n3ebp4vao72g","img":"https://cdn.bs